{"id":"n24492-1-9","stage":3,"title":"구분 · 区分","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24492-1-9-1","ko":"너 바지를 거꾸로 입은 것 같아.","zh":"你裤子好像穿反了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"바지를","meaning":"裤子","explanation":"바지：裤子；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"바지","audio":"/audio/fb24dd66a8c8c7dd42d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66249","senseId":"1","lemma":"바지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바지를","audio":"/audio/c2cad9e1c8ea6755a8a1.mp3"}},{"text":"거꾸로","meaning":"倒着，反着，颠倒地，逆转地","explanation":"거꾸로：倒着，反着，颠倒地，逆转地","readings":[{"term":"거꾸로","audio":"/audio/b5400cfc533033e1a7f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15804","senseId":"1","lemma":"거꾸로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거꾸로","audio":"/audio/b5400cfc533033e1a7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"입은","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입은","audio":"/audio/498d566b215f0ddb04af.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"fb24dd66a8c8c7dd","term":"바지","zh":"裤子","audio":"/audio/fb24dd66a8c8c7dd42d1.mp3","entryId":"66249","definition":"穿在下身的衣物，上面为筒状，下面是可以放腿的两条分叉。","pronunciation":["바지"]},{"id":"b5400cfc533033e1","term":"거꾸로","zh":"倒着，反着，颠倒地，逆转地","audio":"/audio/b5400cfc533033e1a7f3.mp3","entryId":"15804","definition":"顺序、方向、位置等变得相反地。","pronunciation":["거꾸로"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/4dc9f5c44ae102890bf8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24492-1-9-2","ko":"아니야. 이 바지는 앞뒤 구분이 없어.","zh":"没有，这条裤子不分前后。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니야.","meaning":"不是，不对","explanation":"아니야：不是，不对","readings":[{"term":"아니야","audio":"/audio/b8a273e5d75f1fd1734c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29726","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니야","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니야","audio":"/audio/b8a273e5d75f1fd1734c.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"바지는","meaning":"裤子","explanation":"바지：裤子；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"바지","audio":"/audio/fb24dd66a8c8c7dd42d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66249","senseId":"1","lemma":"바지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바지는","audio":"/audio/cae3598b261c334154c2.mp3"}},{"text":"앞뒤","meaning":"前后","explanation":"앞뒤：前后","readings":[{"term":"앞뒤","audio":"/audio/a2da6ec03bdd3f366f26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73065","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞뒤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞뒤","audio":"/audio/a2da6ec03bdd3f366f26.mp3"}},{"text":"구분이","meaning":"区分，划分，区别","explanation":"구분：区分，划分，区别；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"구분","audio":"/audio/d8ba487317ac4e370c54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24492","senseId":"1","lemma":"구분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구분이","audio":"/audio/a0dc3d436a57c84fa14a.mp3"}},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"15","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어","audio":"/audio/d3275bf98baed4550c12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b8a273e5d75f1fd1","term":"아니야","zh":"不是，不对","audio":"/audio/b8a273e5d75f1fd1734c.mp3","entryId":"29726","definition":"用于回答提问，表示强调或坚决否定。","pronunciation":["아니야"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"fb24dd66a8c8c7dd","term":"바지","zh":"裤子","audio":"/audio/fb24dd66a8c8c7dd42d1.mp3","entryId":"66249","definition":"穿在下身的衣物，上面为筒状，下面是可以放腿的两条分叉。","pronunciation":["바지"]},{"id":"a2da6ec03bdd3f36","term":"앞뒤","zh":"前后","audio":"/audio/a2da6ec03bdd3f366f26.mp3","entryId":"73065","definition":"前面和后面。","pronunciation":["압뛰"]},{"id":"d8ba487317ac4e37","term":"구분","zh":"区分，划分，区别","audio":"/audio/d8ba487317ac4e370c54.mp3","entryId":"24492","definition":"根据某一基准把整体分为几个部分。","pronunciation":["구분"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能区分上下、左右、地位等。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c04bb1dcf566759ac3db.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.224,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24492","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":111,"sequenceScore":2.8774,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你裤子好像穿反了。","没有，这条裤子不分前后。","妈妈，您要用这么多线做什么呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你裤子好像穿反了。","没有，这条裤子不分前后。","妈妈，您要用这么多线做什么呢？"],"answer":1}]}
